<b>KaySo note:</b> For a stronger Wisconsin supper-club vibe, use Korbel-style brandy if you already have it. The glaze should be savory-sweet, not candy sweet; add a splash of beef broth if it gets too sticky.</div>
<div class="actions">
<button class="share" data-share="0">↗ Share Recipe</button>
